Subject: [PATCH 02/15] S2-4b step 2: Vape Cloud Dodge at 30 on the GBA
 (stamps: bullets, stars, couch, puffs, cherub, sparkles; the baker stores
 equal pictures once)

Dodge GBA drawn fps 22.5-23 / 20.7 -> 30 / 30 (work 35.9 / 41.9 -> 22.7 / 24.5 ms, no frame over 33 ms).
Frames identical to the plain draw (core: test_stage kept off / on; GBA: vhash-seq of arg 49 / 177).

